// Ysolde of Varr: taken like the player, from another world, and here long
// enough to know how things work. The one who explains the Circle and the
// husks from the point of view of the taken.
Dialogue(
    id: "ysolde",
    start: "greet",
    nodes: {
        "greet": Node(
            speaker: "Ysolde of Varr",
            lines: [
                "Another new one. You have the look - nobody took your mind on the way up, did they? Good.",
            ],
            choices: [
                Choice(text: "Where are we?", next: "where"),
                Choice(text: "What are the husks?", next: "husks"),
                Choice(text: "What is the Circle?", next: "circle"),
                Choice(text: "Farewell.", next: None),
            ],
        ),
        "where": Node(
            speaker: "Ysolde of Varr",
            lines: [
                "A ship the size of a kingdom, over your world. They took me from mine two winters ago. Varr has three moons; I miss them.",
                "The ones in the pods are the ones it took whole. Your people will be among them. They sleep. They are safe - for now.",
            ],
            choices: [Choice(text: "I have more questions.", next: "greet")],
        ),
        "husks": Node(
            speaker: "Ysolde of Varr",
            lines: [
                "Fighters the song got to first. It gets inside the head and scoops it out, and then it wears what is left.",
                "Some of them are your knights. Do not hesitate on account of it. There is nobody in there to spare.",
            ],
            choices: [Choice(text: "I have more questions.", next: "greet")],
        ),
        "circle": Node(
            speaker: "Ysolde of Varr",
            lines: [
                "The Vael will not send anyone into the deep until they know what you can do. So: the Proving Circle. Three champions.",
                "Kesh is quick, Brakka is strong, Morwen is clever. They fight the way you fight - they are warriors, like us. Nobody dies. Mostly.",
                "I lost to Morwen. Twice. Beat her for me.",
            ],
            choices: [Choice(text: "I have more questions.", next: "greet")],
        ),
    },
)
